WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.533
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind technology at home and school.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:11.881
School: uses computers for lessons and reading. Clinic: uses computers for patient

00:00:11.881 --> 00:00:12.340
information.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.511
Shop: uses computers for sales records. Farm: uses technology for weather

00:00:18.511 --> 00:00:22.373
information. Home: uses devices for learning and communication.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.349
In a small group, draw or safely examine pictures of school, clinic and shop. Explain

00:00:28.349 --> 00:00:30.752
one real-life use for each in Ghana.
